  "system": {
    "identifier": "uchiha-barrier-pass-technique",
    "description": "<p>When a you or a jutsu you cast would interact with a jutsu with the Barrier keyword, you can cast this jutsu as part of the same action used to interact with the barrier. When you do, you can make a Ninshou check vs the Jutsu Save DC of the barriers caster. If the Barrier doesn’t have a caster, then you instead make a Ninjutsu Ability Check using the Standard Jutsu Ability Check rules.</p>\n<p>On a success, you or the jutsu you cast bypasses the barrier entirely until the end of the current turn.</p>",
